===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A carved object.
#: ''The '''carvings''' on the oak panels were ancient.''
# The act or craft of producing a carved object.
#: ''He took up '''carving''' after his retirement.''
#: ''My father is an expert in '''carving''', so we let him handle Christmas dinner.''

